Drop fold_probe: the nested fold already lives in the membrane

fold_probe was a flat-machine Rust reproof of nested folding. The membrane's own
numeral already carries it: native_numeral::bits_multiply is recursive Karatsuba,
the nested fold whose depth grows with the value, and factor_membrane uses it
through multiply_via_word in the word ops that get baked and run by vox. A second
copy on the flat machine is drift, so the probe goes; the one copy is
native_numeral.
